            <description><![CDATA[<h2>RestinPID 3.5</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Hard to miss:</b> when an app stops responding, the menu bar icon turns red. It also jiggles every few seconds until you open the panel, like a Dock icon asking for attention.</li>
<li>Turn the jiggle off in Settings → General → Alerts. If Reduce Motion is on in System Settings, the icon stays still and just turns red.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
